OL,3,AJaguar Land Rover to cut 4,000 jobs
OL,4,Aover next two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief executive PB Balaji said the firm
OL,7,Fwas "committed to supporting everyone
OL,8,Fwith care, fairness and respect"
OL,9,Fthrough the redundancy process.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
