OL,3,AChancellor calls for 'confidence about
OL,4,ABritain' despite 'historic high'
OL,5,Aborrowing costs
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnd Healey did not rule out tax
OL,8,Fincreases in next month's Budget, with
OL,9,Fa recent increase in government
OL,10,Fborrowing costs piling pressure on the
OL,11,Fpublic finances.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
