OL,3,AThousands turn out in Serbia for
OL,4,Afuneral of 'Butcher of Bosnia' Ratko
OL,5,AMladiDG
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Serbian government minister had
OL,8,Finitially said that MladiDG would be
OL,9,Fgiven a state funeral b@Kbut those
OL,10,Fplans were changed after objections
OL,11,Ffrom some European leaders. On Monday,
OL,12,Fthe EU denounced MladiDG's
OL,13,F"glorification".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
